    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The spotlight shines once again on Sixtar Gate, introducing STARGAZER, a vibrant blend of rhythm action and engaging storytelling!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Adventure Mode</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3446490/extras/8f5799a77798ed2ea82cb3d7e9c54f21.poster.avif?t=1752223247\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3446490/extras/8f5799a77798ed2ea82cb3d7e9c54f21.webm?t=1752223247\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3446490/extras/8f5799a77798ed2ea82cb3d7e9c54f21.mp4?t=1752223247\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the shoes of the Captain (the protagonist) as you team up with the free-spirited guitarist Dorimi (voiced by Eunjo Lee / Kanako Nomura). Together, uncover a brand-new story set in the Sixtar Gate universe.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Immersive Rhythm Gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3446490/extras/a322e238631c3efe814b4ec67f045185.poster.avif?t=1752223247\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3446490/extras/a322e238631c3efe814b4ec67f045185.webm?t=1752223247\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3446490/extras/a322e238631c3efe814b4ec67f045185.mp4?t=1752223247\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>4-Lane System</strong>: Perfect for rhythm game newcomers, this intuitive layout ensures a smooth and satisfying experience.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Voltage Overdrive System:</strong> Rack up combo chains to supercharge your score and achieve record-breaking performances.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Massive Song Library</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3446490/extras/9f73b3990cfe879a242b200d3b7ba74f.poster.avif?t=1752223247\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3446490/extras/9f73b3990cfe879a242b200d3b7ba74f.webm?t=1752223247\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3446490/extras/9f73b3990cfe879a242b200d3b7ba74f.mp4?t=1752223247\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy over 40 original tracks reimagined in band style, featuring beloved Sixtar Gate songs and new favorites. Stay tuned for free and paid DLC updates, promising fresh content and challenges to keep the beat alive.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Earn, Unlock, Play</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3446490/extras/d25d768a97e832da3a46d1c55cd10062.poster.avif?t=1752223247\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3446490/extras/d25d768a97e832da3a46d1c55cd10062.webm?t=1752223247\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3446490/extras/d25d768a97e832da3a46d1c55cd10062.mp4?t=1752223247\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect in-game currency, Volts, through gameplay and unlock new tracks to expand your playlist.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 40 tracks with additional DLC updates planned.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique Voltage Overdrive system for high-scoring combos.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Intuitive 4-lane rhythm mechanics tailored for accessibility and fun.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engaging Adventure Mode with a heartfelt story.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Let the rhythm guide you as you embark on the ultimate musical adventure in Sixtar Gate: STARGAZER!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The spotlight shines once again on Sixtar Gate, introducing STARGAZER, a vibrant blend of rhythm action and engaging storytelling!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Adventure Mode</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3446490/extras/8f5799a77798ed2ea82cb3d7e9c54f21.poster.avif?t=1752223247\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3446490/extras/8f5799a77798ed2ea82cb3d7e9c54f21.webm?t=1752223247\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3446490/extras/8f5799a77798ed2ea82cb3d7e9c54f21.mp4?t=1752223247\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the shoes of the Captain (the protagonist) as you team up with the free-spirited guitarist Dorimi (voiced by Eunjo Lee / Kanako Nomura). Together, uncover a brand-new story set in the Sixtar Gate universe.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Immersive Rhythm Gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3446490/extras/a322e238631c3efe814b4ec67f045185.poster.avif?t=1752223247\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3446490/extras/a322e238631c3efe814b4ec67f045185.webm?t=1752223247\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3446490/extras/a322e238631c3efe814b4ec67f045185.mp4?t=1752223247\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>4-Lane System</strong>: Perfect for rhythm game newcomers, this intuitive layout ensures a smooth and satisfying experience.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Voltage Overdrive System:</strong> Rack up combo chains to supercharge your score and achieve record-breaking performances.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Massive Song Library</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3446490/extras/9f73b3990cfe879a242b200d3b7ba74f.poster.avif?t=1752223247\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3446490/extras/9f73b3990cfe879a242b200d3b7ba74f.webm?t=1752223247\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3446490/extras/9f73b3990cfe879a242b200d3b7ba74f.mp4?t=1752223247\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy over 40 original tracks reimagined in band style, featuring beloved Sixtar Gate songs and new favorites. Stay tuned for free and paid DLC updates, promising fresh content and challenges to keep the beat alive.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Earn, Unlock, Play</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3446490/extras/d25d768a97e832da3a46d1c55cd10062.poster.avif?t=1752223247\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3446490/extras/d25d768a97e832da3a46d1c55cd10062.webm?t=1752223247\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3446490/extras/d25d768a97e832da3a46d1c55cd10062.mp4?t=1752223247\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect in-game currency, Volts, through gameplay and unlock new tracks to expand your playlist.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 40 tracks with additional DLC updates planned.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique Voltage Overdrive system for high-scoring combos.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Intuitive 4-lane rhythm mechanics tailored for accessibility and fun.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engaging Adventure Mode with a heartfelt story.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Let the rhythm guide you as you embark on the ultimate musical adventure in Sixtar Gate: STARGAZER!</p>",
    "short_description": "&quot;Sixtar Gate: STARGAZER&quot; is a spin-off of the popular rhythm game &quot;Sixtar Gate: STARTRAIL.&quot; Play band-style arrangements of original songs through an intuitive 4-lane system that anyone can enjoy, and explore a new story.",
